From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MobOpt Paper <mobopt@localhost>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add full MobOpt network and explosion optimizations

Port the validated MobOpt fast paths to Paper 1.21.8 without changing the
public Paper API. Retained inbound slices and reserved outbound headroom
remove safe buffer copies, PLAY tick batching avoids redundant selector
wakeups, and explosion recipients use Moonrise's maintained nearby-player
index while preserving the original 64-block distance and packet semantics.

Unsafe buffer ownership, non-PLAY protocols, immediate flushes, async sends,
and disabled settings retain their original Paper paths.

